---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Bulk Orders & Wholesale Stacks | MycoVerse Delivery LA"
  description="Order premium functional mycology, microdose capsules, and botanical products in bulk. Direct priority fulfillment and wholesale pricing from Los Angeles, CA."
>
  <div class="bg-[#1A120B] text-[#FDFBF7] py-16 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 border-b border-[#3E2723]">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
      <nav class="text-xs text-[#D4A373] mb-4 tracking-wider uppercase font-semibold">
        <a href="/" class="hover:underline">Home</a> &gt; <a href="/shop" class="hover:underline">Shop</a> &gt; <span class="text-stone-300">Bulk & Wholesale</span>
      </nav>
      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-black tracking-tight mb-4">
        Wholesale & Bulk <span class="text-[#D4A373]">Orders.</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="max-w-2xl text-stone-300 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
        Scale your retail inventory or secure large-volume microdose capsules, artisan chocolates, and botanical blends directly from our Los Angeles distribution hub. Competitive tier pricing and priority dispatch.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8 items-start">
      
      {/* Wholesale Tiers Overview */}
      <div class="lg:col-span-2 space-y-6">
        <div class="bg-[#FDFBF7] border border-[#3E2723]/15 rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-sm">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#1A120B] mb-2">Bulk Partnership Tiers</h2>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#3E2723]/80 leading-relaxed mb-6">
            We provide custom packaging, white-label options for qualified partners, and absolute batch consistency tested in our Los Angeles facility.
          </p>

          <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4">
            <div class="flex-1 bg-[#F4EFE6] border border-[#3E2723]/10 p-5 rounded-xl flex flex-col justify-between">
              <div>
                <span class="text-[10px] font-bold text-[#C68B59] uppercase tracking-widest">Tier 1</span>
                <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#1A120B] mt-1 mb-2">Micro-Wholesale</h3>
                <p class="text-xs text-[#3E2723]/70 mb-4">Ideal for boutique wellness operators and small curators.</p>
              </div>
              <ul class="text-xs text-[#3E2723] space-y-2 pt-2 border-t border-[#3E2723]/10">
                <li>✓ Minimum Order: $1,500</li>
                <li>✓ 15% Off Catalog Pricing</li>
                <li>✓ Standard Priority Dispatch</li>
              </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="flex-1 bg-[#1A120B] text-[#FDFBF7] border border-[#3E2723] p-5 rounded-xl flex flex-col justify-between">
              <div>
                <span class="text-[10px] font-bold text-[#D4A373] uppercase tracking-widest">Tier 2</span>
                <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mt-1 mb-2">Enterprise Scale</h3>
                <p class="text-xs text-stone-300 mb-4">Designed for major distributors and multi-location retail.</p>
              </div>
              <ul class="text-xs text-stone-200 space-y-2 pt-2 border-t border-[#3E2723]/20">
                <li>✓ Minimum Order: $5,000+</li>
                <li>✓ 25%+ Volume Discount</li>
                <li>✓ Dedicated Account Manager & Custom White-Label</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-[#FDFBF7] border border-[#3E2723]/15 rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-sm">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#1A120B] mb-3">Fulfillment & Compliance Guarantee</h2>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#3E2723]/80 leading-relaxed">
            All bulk consignments are vacuum-sealed, tamper-evident, and dispatched with full laboratory certificate of analysis (COA) documentation to ensure smooth transit across North America.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      {/* Bulk Inquiry Form */}
      <div class="bg-[#1A120B] text-[#FDFBF7] p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-xl flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">Request Wholesale Quote</h2>
          <p class="text-xs text-stone-300 mb-6">Fill out your requirements below and our enterprise desk will respond within 2 hours.</p>

          <form class="space-y-4" action="#" method="POST">
            <div>
              <label class="block text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#D4A373] mb-1">Company / Representative Name</label>
              <input type="text" required class="w-full bg-[#3E2723]/40 border border-[#D4A373]/20 rounded-xl px-4 py-2.5 text-xs text-white focus:outline-none focus:border-[#D4A373]" placeholder="e.g., Nexus Wellness LLC" />
            </div>

            <div>
              <label class="block text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#D4A373] mb-1">Secure Email Address</label>
              <input type="email" required class="w-full bg-[#3E2723]/40 border border-[#D4A373]/20 rounded-xl px-4 py-2.5 text-xs text-white focus:outline-none focus:border-[#D4A373]" placeholder="buyer@company.com" />
            </div>

            <div>
              <label class="block text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#D4A373] mb-1">Product Categories of Interest</label>
              <select class="w-full bg-[#3E2723]/40 border border-[#D4A373]/20 rounded-xl px-4 py-2.5 text-xs text-white focus:outline-none focus:border-[#D4A373]">
                <option value="all">Full Catalog Mix</option>
                <option value="capsules">Microdose Capsules & Stacks</option>
                <option value="chocolates">Artisan Chocolates</option>
                <option value="gummies">Gummies & Extracts</option>
                <option value="strains">Dried Botanical Strains</option>
              </select>
            </div>

            <div>
              <label class="block text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#D4A373] mb-1">Estimated Budget / Volume</label>
              <input type="text" class="w-full bg-[#3E2723]/40 border border-[#D4A373]/20 rounded-xl px-4 py-2.5 text-xs text-white focus:outline-none focus:border-[#D4A373]" placeholder="e.g., $3,000 initial batch" />
            </div>

            <button type="submit" class="w-full bg-[#D4A373] text-[#1A120B] text-xs font-black py-3.5 rounded-xl hover:bg-white transition-all shadow-md uppercase tracking-wider mt-2 cursor-pointer">
              Submit Wholesale Inquiry
            </button>
          </form>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-[#3E2723] text-center text-[10px] text-stone-400">
          🔒 Secure Encrypted B2B Channel • Los Angeles, CA
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>